      "writtenOn": "2024-10-30T14:23:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree, we wanted to get this in during the hackathon as a single push, but the fact it had no verify score pushed it back.  So it would be great to cap this here, get it building and into the plugins ci pipeline so there is an official location to get the jar file. thanks. \nIve a seperate review to get us a verified +1 score for this build in the interim. If not lets get it in a built either way so bazel verifier can take over. \n\n+2 anyone ?",
      "parentUuid": "09184ce5_88071c5a",
      "revId": "a755820030e8880518fe588e96f40b7591a7f5b4",
